    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your vocal chords to conquer a vertical obstacle course! Watch as your beautiful voice converts to real-time speed. Jump, duck, and scream to reach the end!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternatively, you can use your keyboard - but that's for babies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb high and prove that you can overcome the height!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103630/extras/005b94cdd8b1b8c9f46a89ca6a5b62b0.avif?t=1751308288\" width=258 height=157 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skelly Screamer</strong> is a rage game! <strong>Keep your cool</strong>! If you <strong>vocally express your rage</strong>, you might\u00a0 cause a <strong>devastating fall</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103630/extras/a1bd87ad4ff8f56600c7124a22294304.avif?t=1751308288\" width=278 height=113 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge through <strong>5 unique worlds</strong> to beat the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103630/extras/7bff0e1a956f4781134f0d188c59681e.avif?t=1751308288\" width=467 height=157 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bounce pads</strong>, <strong>conveyer belts</strong>, <strong>low gravity</strong> zones, <strong>enemies</strong> who push you off, and <strong>more</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103630/extras/45083d72714a2c52d0361ab7461980dd.avif?t=1751308288\" width=587 height=98 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though <strong>Skelly Screamer</strong> is <strong>meant</strong> to be played with a microphone, you may <strong>use standard keyboard controls</strong> in the alternative\u00a0<strong>Keyboard Mode</strong><i>.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103630/extras/08233ba271b1000c9fc1627936c216ce.avif?t=1751308288\" width=297 height=157 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're<strong> Skelly</strong>, an undead skeleton whose friends describe him as a &quot;chill guy&quot;. This morning, you overslept past your alarm clock and you're <strong>late for work</strong>! Climb through the worlds, higher and higher, to reach your workplace in<strong> space</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103630/extras/5b5dd8059c4cfaad0100b60c74f1c8b6.avif?t=1751308288\" width=320 height=97 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drunk Mode</strong> and other special modes may be unlocked after completing the base game.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your vocal chords to conquer a vertical obstacle course! Watch as your beautiful voice converts to real-time speed. Jump, duck, and scream to reach the end!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternatively, you can use your keyboard - but that's for babies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb high and prove that you can overcome the height!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103630/extras/005b94cdd8b1b8c9f46a89ca6a5b62b0.avif?t=1751308288\" width=258 height=157 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skelly Screamer</strong> is a rage game! <strong>Keep your cool</strong>! If you <strong>vocally express your rage</strong>, you might\u00a0 cause a <strong>devastating fall</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103630/extras/a1bd87ad4ff8f56600c7124a22294304.avif?t=1751308288\" width=278 height=113 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge through <strong>5 unique worlds</strong> to beat the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103630/extras/7bff0e1a956f4781134f0d188c59681e.avif?t=1751308288\" width=467 height=157 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bounce pads</strong>, <strong>conveyer belts</strong>, <strong>low gravity</strong> zones, <strong>enemies</strong> who push you off, and <strong>more</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103630/extras/45083d72714a2c52d0361ab7461980dd.avif?t=1751308288\" width=587 height=98 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though <strong>Skelly Screamer</strong> is <strong>meant</strong> to be played with a microphone, you may <strong>use standard keyboard controls</strong> in the alternative\u00a0<strong>Keyboard Mode</strong><i>.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103630/extras/08233ba271b1000c9fc1627936c216ce.avif?t=1751308288\" width=297 height=157 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're<strong> Skelly</strong>, an undead skeleton whose friends describe him as a &quot;chill guy&quot;. This morning, you overslept past your alarm clock and you're <strong>late for work</strong>! Climb through the worlds, higher and higher, to reach your workplace in<strong> space</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103630/extras/5b5dd8059c4cfaad0100b60c74f1c8b6.avif?t=1751308288\" width=320 height=97 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drunk Mode</strong> and other special modes may be unlocked after completing the base game.</p>",
